    "不设日期即为常年提醒，固定显示在列表顶部，不发通知。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Without a date it's an ongoing reminder: pinned to the top, no notifications."
